silm:instances_papers_25_sheaf_gluing_chapters_01_sheaf_basics_local_sections_sections_01_site_of_mittens_history_concrete_anchor_2#ownerstatement1window silm:hasLongDescription "The OwnerStatement1Window is the June 1st-14th household-log window of two weeks of owner-reported behaviour. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'U_{owner1}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
